Package: sasonr
Title: Independent Implementation of SAS 9.4 Program Semantics in R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Kaiping", "Yang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "1260146556@qq.com")
Description: sasonr is an independent implementation of SAS 9.4 program
    semantics in R, written with reference to the publicly available SAS 9.4
    documentation. Features it does not support fail loud instead of being
    approximated. Compatibility with SAS is not guaranteed. sasonr is not
    affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by SAS Institute Inc. SAS is a
    registered trademark of SAS Institute Inc.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
