    DBI,
    dplyr (>= 1.1.0),
    duckdb,
    R6 (>= 2.4.0),
    rlang,
    tibble,
    vctrs
Suggests:
    haven,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://kaipingyang.github.io/sasonr/, https://github.com/kaipingyang/sasonr
